# CR 903.10a, 903.3: commander damage is counted for the commander card, whatever object it is now. Bot1's commander,
# Raging Goblin (haste), is cast from the command zone on turn 1 and deals Bot2 1 combat damage; Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# kills it, and Bot1 moves it back to the command zone (CR 903.9a). On turn 5 it is cast again for {2}{R} (CR 903.8) - a
# new object (CR 400.7) - and deals 1 more: the two add up to 2 from the one commander.
# Fixture only: Raging Goblin stands in for a commander; the harness does not check commander eligibility.

